Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:22.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:25.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now to test it out... on that pudgy elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.17,0:00:31.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is the elf here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.29,0:00:34.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seriously? No one's home...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.79,0:00:38.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Eh, guess I'll go kill some time\Nand try again later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.42,0:00:48.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,64.8)}{\an7}Plus-Sized Elf
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.33,0:01:46.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(985.6,604.8)}{\an7}Kiddie Cure-all
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.29,0:01:44.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.67,0:01:47.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? You around, Elfuda?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.54,0:01:49.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,She left the front door unlocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.38,0:01:50.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not very considerate...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.58,0:01:52.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is this Elfuda's?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.46,0:01:56.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,All these sugary sodas are the reason\Nshe keeps gaining weight...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:01:58.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,A new flavor...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.25,0:02:00.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It looks tasty...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.83,0:02:03.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll just have a little sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:08.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ugh! Tastes kinda funny...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.25,0:02:16.00,Q3,,0,0,0,,Anyone home?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.25,0:02:16.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Howdy, human!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.21,0:02:18.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,We ran into each other on the-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.42,0:02:21.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,WHAT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.42,0:02:23.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the hell is your problem?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:26.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,You horrible, wicked,\Npeach-emoji-for-an-ass dark elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.71,0:02:31.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was trying to pick the perfect drink\Nto go with my limited-edition French fries...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:34.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,...then you sneak up on me and\Npress the red bean soup button?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:36.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your freakin' mind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.13,0:02:38.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no need to get so huffy about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.38,0:02:39.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.54,0:02:43.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fries and red bean soup?!\NWhat if I get so thirsty I die?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:46.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Would you feel better if I gave you\Nsomething else to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.50,0:02:48.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I left it at the human's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.33,0:02:50.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.21,0:02:53.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted to chat with him,\Nso I dropped by.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.08,0:02:57.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,But it'd be rude to show up empty-handed,\Nso I brought a new flavor of soda.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.71,0:02:59.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,A new soda flavor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.58,0:03:00.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:03.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Soda goes great with French fries!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.21,0:03:08.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good. I managed to convince her\Nto drink the potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.79,0:03:11.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,As for whether my weight loss spell works...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.21,0:03:14.67,Q3,,0,0,0,,French fries, French fries!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.21,0:03:14.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll just use the dim-witted elf\Nas my test subject!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:19.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,And even if it does fail, it's not like it'll\Ncause irreparable side effects or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.58,0:03:21.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Holy guacamole!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:22.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stay with us, human!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.88,0:03:25.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's starting to feel like\NI might've spoken too soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.13,0:03:27.75,Q3,,0,0,0,,C'mon, human! Open your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.13,0:03:27.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:29.08,Q3,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:29.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:30.42,Q3,,0,0,0,,Please wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:30.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Human! Pull yourself together!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:31.63,Q3,,0,0,0,,Human!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:31.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Human! Pull yourself together!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:33.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Elfuda...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:35.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Human! Glad to have you back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.83,0:03:37.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is he a zombie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.38,0:03:38.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Quit houndin' me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:39.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not a dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:41.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,That ain't what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.00,0:03:41.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:45.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wh-wh-what happened to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.71,0:03:47.92,Q3,,0,0,0,,Could it be a calcium deficiency?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.71,0:03:47.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never predicted THIS...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.92,0:03:48.33,Q3,,0,0,0,,Could it be a calcium deficiency?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.92,0:03:48.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a spectacular failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:49.92,Q3,,0,0,0,,Then maybe eatin' some fish will fix him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:49.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a spectacular failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:50.63,Q3,,0,0,0,,Then maybe eatin' some fish will fix him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:50.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Though technically he did lose weight...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.63,0:03:52.17,Q3,,0,0,0,,Clearly that's not the issue!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.63,0:03:52.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Though technically he did lose weight...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.42,0:03:54.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is anything else wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.13,0:03:56.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I think I'm okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.63,0:03:59.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, at least it doesn't\Nseem life-threatening...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.50,0:04:01.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry I scared you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.46,0:04:03.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,But why am I small...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.71,0:04:05.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's glaringly obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.67,0:04:07.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can guess who the culprit is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:09.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,No kiddin'?! Who is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.33,0:04:14.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course the elf with potatoes for brains\Nwould figure it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:17.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,She knows the drink I brought\Nis what caused this whole-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.83,0:04:19.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The satyr!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.33,0:04:20.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:23.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,The satyr was targeting the human!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.42,0:04:26.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,She does have all sorts of magic\Nat her disposal...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.42,0:04:28.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wh-what should we do...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.04,0:04:32.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Punish her with a hundred\Nsmacks on the ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:35.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,If they find out it was me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.54,0:04:39.29,Q3,,0,0,0,,Your clothes are too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.54,0:04:39.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I can't let the truth come to light!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.29,0:04:40.13,Q3,,0,0,0,,Got anything smaller to wear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.29,0:04:40.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I can't let the truth come to light!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.13,0:04:40.92,Q3,,0,0,0,,Got anything smaller to wear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.13,0:04:40.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,First, I've got to hide the evidence...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.92,0:04:42.54,Q3,,0,0,0,,No, of course not...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.92,0:04:42.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,First, I've got to hide the evidence...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.54,0:04:44.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,...and then I'll change the human back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.83,0:04:45.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.50,0:04:46.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wh-what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.92,0:04:49.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,He can barely move in these clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:52.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's head to the mall and pick out\Nsomething a little more child-friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.42,0:04:54.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-sure, whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:57.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll deal with the bottle later...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.33,0:05:00.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for all the trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.67,0:05:04.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly!\NYou're always taking care of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.13,0:05:05.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's the least we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.79,0:05:07.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll find her, make no bones about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.92,0:05:10.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Laika will help look for the satyr, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.21,0:05:13.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Kiddies love chicken nuggets,\Nso we'll bring ya some later!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:14.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:21.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mhm, it suits you nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.42,0:05:23.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Elfuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:26.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,The skeleton crew are\Nout searching for the satyr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.67,0:05:28.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,So stay calm and wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.92,0:05:30.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.17,0:05:32.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got to steal the bottle back
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.54,0:05:36.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,and return the human to his normal size\Nbefore things get out of hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:39.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yo, human!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.54,0:05:40.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,The ogre?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:44.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I promised Oga we'd have\Na cooking lesson today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:46.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It just keeps getting worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.25,0:05:56.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Coochy-coochy-coo! Peek-a-boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:05:58.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Grow up big and strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.63,0:06:00.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're getting out on the count of ten, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:03.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Keep going! Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.42,0:06:05.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.17,0:06:08.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,MY SON!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:10.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop, you're gonna squish him! Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.33,0:06:12.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,No way! He's MINE!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.00,0:06:15.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Her motherly instincts\Nare stronger than I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.33,0:06:17.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, if you can even call it that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.63,0:06:19.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're making the human uncomfortable!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:20.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, no-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.75,0:06:22.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, the human?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.04,0:06:24.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hello...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.88,0:06:28.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,So the satyr cast a spell and\Nturned him into a little rugrat...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:32.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hmm, well...\Nhe's fine like this for now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.21,0:06:33.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You call that "fine"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.88,0:06:35.38,Q3,,0,0,0,,The human's always helping you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.88,0:06:35.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Focus, Kuroeda.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:36.13,Q3,,0,0,0,,The human's always helping you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:36.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,No matter how convoluted the situation may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:37.58,Q3,,0,0,0,,so it's time to help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:37.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,No matter how convoluted the situation may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:38.58,Q3,,0,0,0,,Aww...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,your objective hasn't changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:39.42,Q3,,0,0,0,,Um, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:39.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,your objective hasn't changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:40.25,Q3,,0,0,0,,Um, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:41.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,N-nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.33,0:06:43.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, Oga?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.83,0:06:45.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can call me "Mommy"!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.46,0:06:46.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'll pass...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.42,0:06:49.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,About that cooking lesson I promised...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.71,0:06:52.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,It might be tough since\NI'm smaller than usual...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.63,0:06:53.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.46,0:06:56.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can slip away while they're busy\Ncooking in the kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.63,0:06:58.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:07:01.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Perhaps YOU could assist\Nthe human with his lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:02.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.71,0:07:05.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've got nothing to do\Nuntil they catch the satyr, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:07.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,So why not be productive in the meantime?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.96,0:07:09.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh... Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:12.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,In that case, why don't we do it together?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.21,0:07:13.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.71,0:07:20.83,Q3,,0,0,0,,Today we're making a healthy meat and potato stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.71,0:07:20.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'M getting roped into cooking, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.83,0:07:21.88,Q3,,0,0,0,,A stew?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.83,0:07:21.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,But there's not much I can do about it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.88,0:07:23.21,Q3,,0,0,0,,A potato dish?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.88,0:07:23.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,But there's not much I can do about it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.21,0:07:25.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to bide my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.83,0:07:28.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,My chance to swipe that bottle WILL come...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.38,0:07:30.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,...and I won't let it pass me by!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:32.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm a panther ready to strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:34.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll be in charge of slicing the potatoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.17,0:07:36.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,For the meat, we'll use a lean round steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.75,0:07:39.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's got fewer calories than a ribeye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.08,0:07:40.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.50,0:07:42.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're totally oblivious...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.79,0:07:44.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not very exciting, but I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:46.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd better strike while the iron's-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.17,0:07:50.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, it was you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.83,0:07:52.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You startled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.42,0:07:54.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Quit skulkin' around back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.42,0:07:56.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,For a second, I thought you were the satyr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.50,0:07:59.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,So walking is illegal now?\NGimme a break...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:08:01.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can it! Stop slacking and start cooking!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.21,0:08:02.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Alright, jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.13,0:08:04.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Craaap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.13,0:08:06.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I forgot they both have\Nway more brawn than brains!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.83,0:08:08.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're on ultra high alert...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.71,0:08:10.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't make any careless moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.33,0:08:12.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Screw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.58,0:08:14.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll cook and think at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.71,0:08:17.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait for an opening\Nwhile they're preoccupied...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.63,0:08:18.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait for...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.67,0:08:24.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I got caught up making the stupid stew!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:29.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now we let it simmer for twenty minutes\Nto reduce the excess liquid and it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:31.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.29,0:08:34.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Twenty minutes?\NIt's going to be a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.17,0:08:36.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wanna play a game with Mommy till then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.13,0:08:39.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I think this is a good opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.08,0:08:42.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,to teach you an exercise\Nthat you can do in your free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:47.67,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(819.2,158.4)}{\an7}Standing back leg lifts
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.75,0:08:45.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Standing back leg lifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.25,0:08:47.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,They target your glutes and your hamstrings,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.67,0:08:52.08,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(614.4,144)}{\an7}10-15 reps per leg for 2-3 sets total.\N{\pos(614.4,180)}{\an7}Place your hands on a desk, the back of a chair,\N{\pos(614.4,216)}{\an7}or a wall. Without relying on momentum,\N{\pos(614.4,252)}{\an7}raise your leg up behind you.\N{\pos(614.4,288)}{\an7}Always keep your toes pointed outward.\N{\pos(614.4,324)}{\an7}Be sure your upper body remains stationary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.67,0:08:52.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,so they're beneficial for reducing swelling\Nin your legs and toning your butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:55.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't afford to waste time like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.00,0:08:56.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,It works like a charm!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.92,0:09:00.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I tend to have poor circulation\Nin my legs, so this is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.25,0:09:04.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're even more effective\Nwhen you pair them with a calf exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.88,0:09:07.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,All these reps and sets\Nare really making me sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.83,0:09:09.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm getting thirsty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.79,0:09:11.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you drink this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.58,0:09:14.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.13,0:09:16.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was sitting over there on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.21,0:09:17.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.33,0:09:19.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.42,0:09:22.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I got the bottle back,\Nbut I can't drink it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:25.25,Q3,,0,0,0,,Mwah! Mwah, mwah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:25.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?\NYou're welcome to have some.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:27.08,Q3,,0,0,0,,Nooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:27.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah, I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.25,0:09:28.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's with the shaky voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.71,0:09:30.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,M-my voice isn't shaky, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.75,0:09:33.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a defective potion!\NI can't very well drink it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.13,0:09:37.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,But if I don't drink it now, she might\Nget suspicious and realize the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.96,0:09:40.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.83,0:09:43.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no way out! It's game over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.13,0:09:47.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y'know, you're acting kinda funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.38,0:09:47.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you hiding somethi-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.96,0:09:48.79,Q3,,0,0,0,,I CAN'T TAKE IT!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.96,0:09:48.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you hiding somethi-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.79,0:09:49.75,Q3,,0,0,0,,I CAN'T TAKE IT!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.13,0:09:50.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,My eyes! My eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.63,0:09:52.71,Q3,,0,0,0,,K-Kuroeda, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.63,0:09:52.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,My eyes! My eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.50,0:09:58.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,So it was a defective weight loss potion\Nthat caused this whole mess,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.00,0:10:00.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,and the dark elf was the culprit...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.13,0:10:04.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You despicable dark elf\Nand your megalo-butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:06.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why would you do such a thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.38,0:10:09.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't do it on purpose...\NBlimp-bellied elf...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.63,0:10:10.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.71,0:10:14.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,N-now, now... There's no need\Nto get so angry, Elfuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.54,0:10:19.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,If the victim himself says so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.54,0:10:23.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Kuroeda, why'd you make\Nthe weight loss potion?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.67,0:10:26.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're an honest, upstanding person,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.96,0:10:29.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,so I feel like you must have\Nsome sort of reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.83,0:10:32.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.25,0:10:35.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You helped me out, so I just thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.71,0:10:39.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought a weight loss potion might\Nmake your job a little bit easier...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.33,0:10:43.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I never meant for THIS to happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:44.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:49.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm really happy you feel\Nthat way, Kuroeda.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:55.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,But... no matter how easy it'd make things,\NI'd rather not rely on those types of drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.08,0:10:58.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,'Cause I love this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.00,0:10:59.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Human...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.13,0:11:03.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why I'd rather do it myself -
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.29,0:11:05.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,so that I can feel like I'm providing people
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:07.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,with the best care possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.63,0:11:09.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's full-grown again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.33,0:11:10.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:12.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,OVERgrown...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.38,0:11:13.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.88,0:11:16.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Talk about severe side effects...
